        },
        {
          "ac_id": "AC-S-001-US2-2",
          "format": "gherkin",
          "text": "Given production, When a visitor opens the site, Then the web app is served from the CDN, requests under `/api` are routed through the load balancer and web application firewall to the API, and all traffic uses HTTPS"
        },
        {
          "ac_id": "AC-S-001-US2-3",
          "format": "gherkin",
          "text": "Given production, When one API replica or one zone is lost, Then the other replica keeps serving online booking, and under sustained CPU above 60% the API scales between 2 and 4 replicas"
